# Line endings, diff drivers and GitHub hints (repo-layouts.md §1).
* text=auto eol=lf
# .FCStd is a zip file: readable diffs through the textconv driver `fcstd` (set by the
# workspace bootstrap, D63, D100); it cannot be merged, so a conflict means: take one side
# and redo the other change. Board models are written by `curatrix cam`, never by hand.
*.FCStd diff=fcstd -merge -text
*.FCBak binary
